---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";

const updated = "29 October 2026";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="What happens to the information you send through a Harikita Studio inquiry."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <p class="text-eyebrow uppercase text-ink-muted">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-title">What we do with your details</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-caption text-ink-muted">Last updated {updated}</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-body">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-card">What you send us</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink-muted">
          If you use the commission form, that is your names, an email address or
          WhatsApp number, your wedding date, colour and style preferences, your
          story, and any links you choose to share. Nothing else.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-card">Where it goes</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink-muted">
          The form is hosted by Tally Solutions BV. Your submission is stored in
          their system and forwarded to us by email. We do not run our own
          database, and we are the only people who read it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-card">What this site does not do</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink-muted">
          No analytics, no advertising pixels, no tracking cookies, no profiles of
          visitors. The pages are static files; the only script that runs is the
          embedded form itself, and only on the commission page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-card">How long we keep it</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink-muted">
          Inquiries we do not take on are deleted within twelve months. If we work
          together, we keep the correspondence for as long as you might reasonably
          need us to, and no longer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-card">Removing your data</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink-muted">
          Reply to any email we have sent you and ask for it to be deleted, and we
          will remove the inquiry from Tally and from our inbox. You do not need to
          give a reason.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-card">Your artwork</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink-muted">
          The artwork is made for you. We would like to show finished pieces in the
          portfolio, always without your guest details — tell us at any point if you
          would rather we did not, and we will take it down.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-card">Questions</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink-muted">
          Use the{" "}
          <a
            class="underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink"
            href="/commission">commission form</a
          >{" "}
          and mention privacy. That reaches us the same way an inquiry does.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-12 border-t border-line pt-6 text-caption text-ink-muted">
      {site.name} · {site.domain}
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>